00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.810
This is how a real male dies!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.440
Is that Terry?

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:07.950
I can't stand it anymore, father!

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:09.700
Let's do it!

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:12.790
Follow me!

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:18.550
They're trying to escape!

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:19.550
What?

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:28.680
Rain! Rain!

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:31.060
Wait!

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:32.520
They're attacking!

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.060
Make a circle!

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.730
Little one, stay close to uncle.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:43.250
Good.

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:50.200
Don't move an inch!

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:51.950
Withdraw!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:57.050
If you don't withdraw, Silver from
Ouu will be your opponent!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.130
Silver!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:17:59.560
He came in time!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.050
The three brothers from Kai!

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:03.970
No shortage of opponents!

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:05.300
Come at me anytime!

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:08.050
Iga's Akame!

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:08.800
Kirikaze!

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:09.550
Jinnai!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:10.440
Shut up!

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:10.860
Hold on!
Shut up!

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:11.440
Hold on!

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:15.120
The true king of Mutsu, Benizakura!

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:17.060
Silver, you made it!

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:18.330
Ben!

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:20.870
Ben, are your eyes good?

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:21.810
They are good.

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:22.840
Where's Cross?

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:26.240
Don't worry, I've put
her in a safe place.

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:27.450
That's good.

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:28.950
They are coming!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:37.290
<i>It was Silver's 92 dogs against
The Heavenly Kings 360 dogs.</i>

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.720
<i>Against an enemy of quadruple size...</i>

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.220
<i>It was a violent battle!</i>

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:55.640
Silver! Leave him to me!
He killed Terry!

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:06.820
Little one!

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:07.990
Quit it!

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:09.990
Your bastard!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:15.000
Little one, stick to uncle!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:23.970
Wait there!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:26.550
Stop it!

00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:28.180
Stop fighting everyone!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:29.680
What is it, Ben?

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:31.430
What happened?

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.220
Look up!

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:40.730
What are they holding?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.450
<i>Terry!</i>

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.500
Terry...

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:02.960
<i>Heavenly Kings...
That is our real enemy!</i>

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:04.960
Terry!

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.260
Follow Silver!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.770
<i>They're climbing up that cliff!</i>

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:17.020
<i>That cliff...</i>

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:21.320
<i>The courage to ignore us
and confront the bears.</i>

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.740
<i>By comparison we are...</i>

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:27.450
<i>You are nothing compared to
the males fighting Akakabuto!</i>

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.950
<i>What a small male you are!</i>

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:36.670
My friends!

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:38.470
Follow the warriors of Ouu!

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:44.970
<i>Enemy became allies, and
made a total of 450 dogs.</i>

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:47.410
<i>"Terry's Killer"</i>

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:51.500
<i>Those words made it all possible.</i>

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.410
<i>Terry's killer!</i>

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.420
Terry did not die in vain.

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:34.170
Thanks to Terry, our goals
have become one.

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:35.170
Ben!

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:38.420
Can you forgive us for killing Terry?

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:41.440
No Kisaragi! We didn't kill Terry.

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.230
Not the final blow.

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:45.430
But we drove him to his death!

00:21:47.190 --> 00:21:48.440
I wonder, Kisaragi...

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:49.940
I was watching.

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:53.190
It was a bear that killed
Terry in that forest!

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:07.290
Don't let this anger be in vain!

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:11.300
Ben, I need to ask you again.

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:13.300
Can we join your pack?

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:16.550
Everyone! You don't have
any objections, right?!

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:16.640
No!

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:16.730
No!
No!

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.060
No!
No!
No!

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:24.130
Well said, Kisaragi.

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:27.650
We pledge that Terry's
death was not in vain.

00:22:27.810 --> 00:22:28.780
Understood!

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:30.320
We'll take down Akakabuto!

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:41.070
<i>With Terry's death,
a new army has been born.</i>

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:44.950
<i>Ouus and Mutsus combined army,
was 450 dogs strong.</i>

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:48.950
<i>It was a big step towards
the strength needed-</i>

00:22:48.990 --> 00:22:50.630
<i>- to beat Akakabuto's castle.</i>

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:55.630
<i>Thus, the confrontation with
Akabuto was approaching.</i>

00:22:55.930 --> 00:23:00.640
<b>To be continued...</b>

00:23:14.930 --> 00:23:20.180
When a shower of a moonlight

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:26.310
bathes you gently

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:32.450
Say goodbye to pain and

00:23:34.290 --> 00:23:41.010
let it flow away

00:23:41.170 --> 00:23:47.010
For he who lives today with all his heart

00:23:47.310 --> 00:23:53.640
a better tomorrow will surely come

00:23:53.980 --> 00:23:59.820
TOMORROW, let us run again

00:24:00.650 --> 00:24:05.700
TOMORROW, lets shine brightly
